  m_text: '

    <size=120%><b><color=#FFD76A>WELCOME, APPRENTICE!</color></b></size>


    <b>YOUR
    ALCHEMY ADVENTURE</b>


    1. <b>POUR</b> reactants into the cauldron.

    2.
    <b>TRACE</b> the portal to explore molecules.

    3. <b>STIR</b> the mixture.

    4.
    <b>HEAT</b> the flask.


    <color=#FFD76A><b>START WITH EXPERIMENT 01!</b></color>


    <size=90%>GRIP
    = Pick up

    THUMBSTICK = Move

    B = Return from molecular world</size>

'
